# Client state of sys-levelup-state: the 1.14d client unit sets (traces/pc1/client-state/sys-levelup-state.cstate.jsonl, state-snapshot.md section 3 rule 5) against the ClientWorld of d2-client (state-dump --client-out); same save, seed, pokes and input as sys-levelup-state.
# Census: experience and level-up (combat/vitals.md §3-§4), state channel:
# save-levelup-ama's kills (Fire Bolt missiles into a level-63 spawn from a
# 499-strength-point amazon) compared on the state channel instead of the
# save channel.
name cs-sys-levelup-state
save SavAma --class ama --expansion --stat 13=499
seed 1234
ticks 110
seconds 300
channels cstate
at 4 poke warp 2
at 30 poke seed-game 0x00001234 666
at 30 poke seed-unit @player 0x00000055 666
at 30 poke spawn 63 @x+4 @y+4 normal
at 34 poke missile 12 @x @y @x+4 @y+4 skill 7 20
at 42 poke missile 12 @x @y @x+4 @y+4 skill 7 20
at 50 poke missile 12 @x @y @x+4 @y+4 skill 7 20
at 58 poke missile 12 @x @y @x+4 @y+4 skill 7 20
at 66 poke missile 12 @x @y @x+4 @y+4 skill 7 20
